cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Pdf Rename"
message: "If this tool helped your work, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "A K M Ahasun"
    family-names: "Habib"
    affiliation: "M3D Lab, Department of Mechanical Engineering, Texas Tech University"
abstract: >-
  A Windows desktop tool that renames downloaded research papers to
  YYYY_Title.pdf using bibliographic records resolved from the DOI printed in
  the PDF, verified against the document text before any file is renamed.
keywords:
  - bibliography
  - reference-management
  - crossref
  - doi
  - pdf
license: MIT
version: "3.0"
date-released: "2026-09-21"
